{"ID":"20240205153840-g6sofad","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153840-g6sofad","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153840-g6sofad\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140753-64vn188\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194639-w5rtj49\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:948,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194639-w5rtj49\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"马勃","type":"doc","updated":"20240903091933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140753-64vn188","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140753-64vn188","updated":"20240206140801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产内蒙古、甘肃、河北、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t脱皮马勃：呈扁球形或类球形，无不孕基部，直径1520cm。包被灰棕色至黄褐色，纸质，常破碎呈块片状，或已全部脱落。孢体灰褐色或浅褐色，紧密，有弹性，用手撕之，内有灰褐色棉絮状的丝状物。触之则孢子呈尘土样飞扬，手捻有细腻感。气似尘土，无味。大马勃：不孕基部小或无，残留的包被由黄棕色的膜状外包被和较厚的灰黄色的内包被所组成，光滑，制裁硬而脆，成块脱落；孢体浅青褐色，手捻有润滑感。紫色马勃：呈陀螺形，或已压扁呈扁圆形，直径512cm，不孕基部发达；包被薄，2层，紫褐色，粗皱，有圆形凹陷，外翻，上部常裂成小块或已部分脱落；孢体紫色。\n【性味】\t辛，平。\n【功效】\t局部止血药，清肺，利咽，解热等。\n【注解】\t“粉尘”：泛指药材折断或破碎后飞扬出来的粉状物质。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140753-mc3zaks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140753-mc3zaks","updated":"20240206140753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140753-4lu0pap.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730095507-tdjsavc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730095507-tdjsavc","updated":"20240730095834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 584px;","style":"width: 574px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240730095507-5bftwue.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 574px;\" parent-style=\"width: 584px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 584px;","style":"width: 574px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马勃"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马勃-20240730093942-w2r3l0i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 574px;\" parent-style=\"width: 584px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730101006-g3x9or5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730101006-g3x9or5","updated":"20240730101057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 572px;","style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马勃 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马勃 8-20240730101006-zeh4s2r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\" parent-style=\"width: 572px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马勃 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马勃 9-20240730101057-1qhsg2a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730101144-10p076s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730101144-